# collatz: prints the trajectory of 6, "6 3 10 5 16 8 4 2 1 "
#
# Row 0 seeds n=6 and drops the eye into the loop. The turn at (1,0) sets
# heading south, so the cell it lands on -- (1,1) -- must turn it east again
# before the body runs: headings persist until a triangle changes them.
#
# Row 1 is the loop body and is exactly as wide as the plate, so running off
# the east edge wraps straight back to its own start. Its first three cells
# are all unconditional turn-east triangles, reached from three different
# places: (0,1) is the wrap point every pass takes; (1,1) is where the seed's
# southward drop lands on the very first pass; (2,1) is where the odd branch
# (row 2) returns via a north-facing triangle. All three just reassert
# heading east, so on an ordinary wrap they are three harmless no-ops before
# the real body starts at (3,1) -- exactly the countdown plate's redundant
# entry cell, tripled because this plate has three ways to enter the row.
#
# The body itself, stack holding [n]: DUP + OUT_NUM prints n; a literal space
# (push 4, push_acc 0 -> 32) is printed; DUP + push 1 + EQ + TURN_IF exits
# south when n is 1 -- into row 2's void gap at column 11, which halts on
# landing; otherwise DUP + push 2 + MOD + TURN_IF deflects south when n is
# odd, into row 2's column 15. The even path falls through to push 2 + DIV,
# replacing n with n // 2, and wraps around to (0,1) for the next pass.
#
# Row 2 is void everywhere except two spans. Column 11, mid-void, is the halt
# target for n == 1: any void cell halts the instant the eye lands on it, so
# no special marker is needed there beyond simply not drawing a shape.
# Columns 15-17 and 0-2 (wrapping across the row's own east edge) hold the
# odd branch: an entry turn-east (needed for the same reason row 1's entry
# cells are, since the drop from row 1 arrives heading south), then
# push 3, mul, push 1, add computing 3n + 1, then a turn-north at column 2
# that returns to row 1's column 2 -- the third of its entry triangles.
%plate 18x3

o.67  v..7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7
>..7  >..7  >..7  %..7  +..7  o.47  o1.7  +1.7  %..7  o.17  D2.7  v1.7  %..7  o.27  #4.7  v1.7  o.27  #3.7
o.17  #..7  ^..7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  ...7  >..7  o.37  #2.7
